  date: "2026-10-25",
  body: `Prior Lessons — 1-Sentence Recap

Lesson 075: Packaging topology determines where dense connections belong while balancing bandwidth, heat, yield and supplier flexibility.

Lesson 076: HBM4 makes memory, its logic base die, the package and the accelerator one jointly engineered data path.

Lesson 077: A package substrate translates fine die connections into board-level power and signals while resisting warpage.

